Grammar

Rule 0     S' -> programa
Rule 1     programa -> instrucao
Rule 2     programa -> programa instrucao
Rule 3     instrucao -> let_statement SEMICOLON
Rule 4     instrucao -> fun_statement SEMICOLON
Rule 5     instrucao -> expressao SEMICOLON
Rule 6     let_statement -> LET ID COLON tipo ASSIGN expressao
Rule 7     let_statement -> LET ID ID ASSIGN expressao
Rule 8     let_statement -> LET ID ASSIGN expressao
Rule 9     fun_statement -> FUN ID COLON tipo ARROW tipo
Rule 10    expressao -> WHEN LPAREN expressao RPAREN IS cases END
Rule 11    expressao -> WHEN expressao IS cases END
Rule 12    cases -> case
Rule 13    cases -> cases case
Rule 14    case -> pattern_list ARROW expressao SEMICOLON
Rule 15    case -> UNDERSCORE ARROW expressao SEMICOLON
Rule 16    pattern_list -> pattern
Rule 17    pattern_list -> pattern_list COMMA pattern
Rule 18    pattern -> INT
Rule 19    pattern -> SUBTRACTION INT
Rule 20    pattern -> TRUE
Rule 21    pattern -> FALSE
Rule 22    pattern -> ID
Rule 23    expressao -> expressao SUM expressao
Rule 24    expressao -> expressao SUBTRACTION expressao
